WEBVTT

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:30.316
What’s your background?

00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:35.156
And like any proud
Aboriginal child would declare,

00:01:35.196 --> 00:01:36.756
“I’m Aboriginal.”

00:01:37.796 --> 00:01:40.196
Given the reaction of the room,

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:44.076
being Aboriginal was clearly a dirty word.

00:01:44.596 --> 00:01:46.756
And at the tender age of 11,

00:01:46.796 --> 00:01:50.756
I was told by my best
friend’s adult sister

00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:53.876
that I was too pretty to be Aboriginal.

00:01:55.316 --> 00:02:00.196
By this time, my mouth is dry,
my blood is boiling,